        {EObjective::Talk, TEXT("Ask Old Lama Lobsang about the disturbance in the Northern Wilderness"), TEXT("向老喇嘛・洛桑詢問北郊原野的異狀"), 1, TEXT("Lately, the Northern Wilderness beyond the north gate has grown restless with karmic obstacles, and a traveler dropped an \"Ancient Pilgrim's Map\" beside a tilted Mani stone cairn in the mid-wilderness."), TEXT("近來佛塔北門之外的「北郊原野」障氣躁動，山風中夾雜著狂暴的氣息，連往來的朝聖者也在中段傾斜的瑪尼堆附近遺落了珍貴的「古老的朝聖地圖」。"), TEXT("oldLama"), TEXT("Old Lama Lobsang"), TEXT("老喇嘛・洛桑")},
