        {EObjective::Talk, TEXT("Speak with the Pharping Village Elder about the three-year drought"), TEXT("與帕平村長老交談，了解三年大旱之苦"), 1, TEXT("\"May the Three Jewels bless you, traveler. This valley of Pharping beneath your feet has not seen a single drop of rain for three whole years.\""), TEXT("「遠方來的行者啊，願三寶護佑你。你雙足踏上的這片帕平谷地，已經整整三年沒有落下一滴雨水了。」"), TEXT("villageElder"), TEXT("Pharping Village Elder"), TEXT("帕平村長老")},
